    },
    {
      "displayText": "你帮我的飞天螳螂掌握了修剪技巧，\n所以有件事希望你能挑战一下！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605E2E6211768498DE592987B38782638C63E14E864FEE526A62805DE7FF0C000A62404EE567094EF64E8B5E0C671B4F6080FD631162184E004E0BFF0100100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就像卡洛斯地区有\n宝可梦联盟那样！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3150CF53616D1B65AF5730533A6709000A5B9D53EF68A6805476DF90A36837FF0100100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷市有\n多丽米亚联盟！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F75E026709000A591A4E3D7C734E9A805476DFFF0100100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所谓多丽米亚联盟，就是\n优中选优的多丽米亚训练家们<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n较量多丽米亚实力的联盟。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62408C13591A4E3D7C734E9A805476DFFF0C5C31662F000A4F184E2D90094F187684591A4E3D7C734E9A8BAD7EC35BB64EEC00100001BE00000A8F8391CF591A4E3D7C734E9A5B9E529B7684805476DF300200100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "被称为四天王的4个训练家，\n正等待着挑战者上门挑战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88AB79F04E3A56DB5929738B768400344E2A8BAD7EC35BB6FF0C000A6B637B495F8577406311621880054E0A95E863116218300200100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "四天王们身处于\n密阿雷的4间餐厅里。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56DB5929738B4EEC8EAB59044E8E000A5BC6963F96F77684003495F49910538591CC300200100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果要挑战四天王，\n请在同行队伍里只带上多丽米亚。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C89816311621856DB5929738BFF0C000A8BF75728540C884C961F4F0D91CC53EA5E264E0A591A4E3D7C734E9A300200100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是你感兴趣的话，就把\n多丽米亚联盟的四天王通通打败吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F4F60611F51748DA376848BDDFF0C5C31628A000A591A4E3D7C734E9A805476DF768456DB5929738B901A901A62538D255427FF0100100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是多丽米亚联盟四天王中\n专精歌舞伎造型的弥叶。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F591A4E3D7C734E9A805476DF56DB5929738B4E2D000A4E137CBE6B4C821E4F0E9020578B76845F2553F63002001000020114015C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要挑战我的话，\n麻烦你同行队伍里只带多丽米亚。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898163116218621176848BDDFF0C000A9EBB70E64F60540C884C961F4F0D91CC53EA5E26591A4E3D7C734E9A3002001000020114015C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让我在对战中告诉你\n多丽米亚歌舞伎造型的魅力吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
