      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对多丽米亚来说，什么造型\n是最有魅力的，必须得出定论才行。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF9591A4E3D7C734E9A67658BF4FF0C4EC04E489020578B000A662F670067099B45529B7684FF0C5FC5987B5F9751FA5B9A8BBA624D884C3002001000020114015C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
