      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "歌舞伎意味着非比寻常的事物。\n用这造型居然赢不了，太不可思议了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B4C821E4F0E610F54737740975E6BD45BFB5E3876844E8B72693002000A75288FD99020578B5C4571368D624E0D4E86FF0C592A4E0D53EF601D8BAE4E863002001000020114015C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但多丽米亚四天王的\n实力可不只如此！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
