    },
    {
      "displayText": "是的……由于5年前发生的事件，\n为多丽米亚提供修剪服务的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n宝可美容沙龙馆关门了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 4916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F76842026202675314E8E00355E74524D53D1751F76844E8B4EF6FF0C000A4E3A591A4E3D7C734E9A63D04F9B4FEE526A670D52A1768400100001BE00000A5B9D53EF7F8E5BB96C999F999986517395E84E86300200100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷的多丽米亚爱好者们\n可是伤透了心。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n大家都以为再也没办法\n为心爱的多丽米亚改变造型了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 5012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F77684591A4E3D7C734E9A7231597D80054EEC000A53EF662F4F24900F4E865FC3300200100001BE01000A59275BB690FD4EE54E3A518D4E5F6CA1529E6CD5000A4E3A5FC372317684591A4E3D7C734E9A653953D89020578B4E86300200100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但此时，救世主出现了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 91,
      "offsetInSection": 5120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F466B6465F6FF0C65514E164E3B51FA73B04E86300200100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就是你啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 92,
      "offsetInSection": 5152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F4F60554A300200100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "修剪多丽米亚这门技术，\n只靠秀简和飞天螳螂的话，一直都很难掌握。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 93,
      "offsetInSection": 5172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4FEE526A591A4E3D7C734E9A8FD995E86280672FFF0C000A53EA976079C07B80548C98DE592987B3878276848BDDFF0C4E0076F490FD5F8896BE638C63E1300200100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你不仅很自然地让飞天螳螂学会了这门技术，\n自己还站到了多丽米亚联盟的顶点！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 94,
      "offsetInSection": 5248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604E0D4EC55F8881EA713657308BA998DE592987B387825B664F1A4E868FD995E86280672FFF0C000A81EA5DF18FD87AD952304E86591A4E3D7C734E9A805476DF7684987670B9FF0100100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "被你的英姿感动的人们想必也会\n像我们创立多丽米亚联盟那样，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n去创立粉蝶蛹联盟\n和龟脚脚联盟等等！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 95,
      "offsetInSection": 5332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88AB4F60768482F159FF611F52A876844EBA4EEC60F35FC54E5F4F1A000A50CF62114EEC521B7ACB591A4E3D7C734E9A805476DF90A36837FF0C00100001BE01000A53BB521B7ACB7C89877686F9805476DF000A548C9F9F811A811A805476DF7B497B49FF0100100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "希望你能在所有宝可梦各自的\n联盟上展现对宝可梦的爱。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 96,
      "offsetInSection": 5444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E0C671B4F6080FD5728624067095B9D53EF68A6540481EA7684000A805476DF4E0A5C5573B05BF95B9D53EF68A676847231300200100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把话扯远了……\n今后也请常来为多丽米亚修剪哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
